Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.21,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The land
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.50,0:00:31.76,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of paradise,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be able to make my own hand.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.06,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.80,0:00:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be able to
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.77,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.90,0:00:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,make my own way.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.44,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.91,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.84,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.84,0:01:16.47,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.47,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.66,0:01:18.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Simba Toribokose!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.66,0:01:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,found their Digi-Eggs inside of a cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.08,0:01:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gatomon was finally able to\NArmor Digivolve into Nefertimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.82,0:01:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Patamon transformed into Pegasmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.66,0:01:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And with their help,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.82,0:02:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we defeated the Tyranomon and broke them\Nfree from the Digimon Emperor's dark rings.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.60,0:02:10.02,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\pos(310,333)}King of Darkness, Digimon Kaiser
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.58,0:02:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon Kaiser!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.24,0:02:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boys, easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.12,0:02:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are officially fugitives!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.72,0:02:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the kind of puny defense that\Nthe Digimon Emperor's gonna put up,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then this fight will be\Nover in the first round!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.14,0:02:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, the fact that it was so easy\Nfor us to break out of that prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.14,0:02:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there wasn't a single\Nguard anywhere around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:42.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he wanted us to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.40,0:02:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.31,0:02:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He took one look at our awesome\Nskills, and he hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:52.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, actually, Davis, I'm\Ngonna have to agree with T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is not gonna let us get away\Nthat easy without some kind of reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:02:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll worry about it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get back to the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.68,0:03:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.60,0:03:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can practically smell\Nthe cafeteria from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.78,0:03:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my peanut butter and jelly bean
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.16,0:03:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sandwich I've had in my\Npocket since last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.30,0:03:08.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:09.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.30,0:03:16.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the next one should be\Nin place right about now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.94,0:03:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there now to let everyone\Nknow who's the boss
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.28,0:03:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this control spire is the\Nmost dominating object
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.94,0:03:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the digi world\Nwherever i build one that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,area will be under my\Ncontrol and all those
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.80,0:03:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,around it will be my\Nslaves it's useless to try
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and escape those who do\Nwill have to answer to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.08,0:03:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my soldiers how do i get\Nmyself into these things
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.92,0:03:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy bringing\Nthe Gotsumon back from the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.44,0:03:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digital world but we didn't\Nhave a choice we couldn't just
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leave them there for the\NDigimon Emperor to make into
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:54.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slaves right yep but how are\Nwe going to explain it if mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.94,0:03:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fujiyama happens to\Ncome in here don't worry
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.22,0:03:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell him I'm taking\Na sculpting class and
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.20,0:04:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these are some of my\Nearly masterpieces hit
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it boys early rejects\Nmight be a better phrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.34,0:04:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoli, I've got a big favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.22,0:04:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would it be all right with you\Nif I borrowed your digivice?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.42,0:04:13.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what for? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's obvious the power from your digivices\Nopens the gate to the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.82,0:04:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our old digivices don't seem to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.86,0:04:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.77,0:04:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've tried using mine, but no luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.56,0:04:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way we can get into the digital
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.66,0:04:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,world is if one of you\Nopens the gate for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.26,0:04:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I wanted to try and experiment with the\Nnew digivices, if that's okay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.12,0:04:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.25,0:04:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got an early tea time in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.24,0:04:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're busting out tonight, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.64,0:04:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, why wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.60,0:04:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, stay to the back of the cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blue Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, you don't\Nlisten to instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:04:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the Digi-World's biggest\Nsalad bar, Red Veggiemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the biggest and the\Nripest of all Vegiemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.72,0:05:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stink jet attack destroys\Nmy enemies with noxious fumes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.50,0:05:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to stop us, Stinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For trying to escape, you\Nget to smell my roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:18.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I have root rot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.16,0:05:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smell this! Yuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.26,0:05:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smell it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.64,0:05:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more, please! You kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just warming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you can't stand the smell,\Nthen get out of the kitchen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.72,0:05:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fur is dry clean only!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.86,0:05:46.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let that be a lesson to all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.66,0:05:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't try to defy the power\Nof the Digimon Emperor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.42,0:05:57.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to tell the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:06:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They need to be warned.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, I stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may not always be that way
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.60,0:06:18.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't take nothing for granted
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.30,0:06:35.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, T.K.,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.21,0:06:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just because I have a\Nrock band doesn't mean I
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can hide a band of rocks\Nthat happen to be Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.46,0:06:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.56,0:06:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe they could be your backup singers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.10,0:06:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sound too gravely.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.26,0:06:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I have your autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.41,0:06:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.33,0:06:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just make it to June Motomiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:51.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say Motomiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't happen to be\NDavis' sister, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.38,0:06:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His name's TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.44,0:06:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:06:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your younger brother Davis and I\Nare in the same class together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.34,0:07:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you sign my shirt, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.70,0:07:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get all the cute boys to sign it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may not know it, but I haven't\Nwashed this shirt in two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's not a lot of room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.79,0:07:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think all boys are cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.84,0:07:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's some kind of trouble\Nin the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got an e-mail. It's from Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says, emergency, hurry back to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope Gabumon's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:28.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.20,0:07:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.18,0:07:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you go any faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, the gate's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.28,0:07:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Matt, Gabumon, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.60,0:08:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just say I'll never look at\Nsteamed vegetables the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.84,0:08:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I want you to tell me\Neverything that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.14,0:08:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We never talk anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.26,0:08:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going over to Izzy's\Nto get my digivice back,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then I'll meet up with you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.58,0:08:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have no fear while Yoli's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.70,0:08:15.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This day shall be guarded by poor man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do they call those things\Non top of the TV rabbit ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.78,0:08:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't they call them cat ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.70,0:08:25.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, when was the last time you\Nsaw a rabbit sleeping on top of a TV?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.68,0:08:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what you think of?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, break's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.66,0:08:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a small village called Santa Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:34.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.51,0:08:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like it's in California.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.86,0:08:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was always a quiet place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone minded their own business, and\Nthen the Digimon Emperor came along.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, there's one of those\Nthings that scared the Gotsumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Emperor calls them Control Spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.70,0:08:48.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.66,0:08:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't just rush in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.34,0:08:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.25,0:08:56.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's in there waiting for us and this\Nwhole thing is just some kind of ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.30,0:08:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we have to do is armor\NDigivolve and blow them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.22,0:09:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.50,0:09:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be using some of the Digimon\Nhostages as a shield to protect himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.58,0:09:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K.'s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.49,0:09:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find a way\Nto rescue the hostages
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and make sure that none of them get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.42,0:09:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're being guarded by the Vegiemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.22,0:09:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out for the Digi-Sludge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.42,0:09:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, tell us everything\Nyou know about Red Vegiemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.10,0:09:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like we're\Nnot needed around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.34,0:09:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go off and do things our own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.22,0:09:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should all stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.26,0:09:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I've got a plan\Nto sneak into the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.74,0:09:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.98,0:09:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't take the chance that any of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,especially Kari, might be\Nattacked with that Digi-Sludge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.58,0:09:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.78,0:09:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we've been attacked by a\Nlot worse things than Digi-Sludge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.78,0:09:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.61,0:09:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I can't even believe you're not\Nworried about Kari's well-being, T.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .A.?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.13,0:09:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He forgot how to spell T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.70,0:09:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:09:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Identify yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.51,0:10:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just captured these\NDigimon and their friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.48,0:10:05.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you taking us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.06,0:10:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hide down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.97,0:10:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all going to jail where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.94,0:10:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys didn't even notice\Nthese rings are plastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.48,0:10:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't start feeling too frisky yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.44,0:10:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first set of guards\Nwere just flunkies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.48,0:10:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We haven't even faced\Nthe pick of the litter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even if we get past them,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we still have to find a way\Nto destroy the control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.84,0:10:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for bringing the prisoners in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Emperor will be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could have caught them ourselves, you\Nknow, but I guess you beat us to the punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.00,0:10:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, speaking of\Npunch, lightning pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet, there are more guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.10,0:11:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a string.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.01,0:11:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The exit is blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.50,0:11:10.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never get out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of hiding anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.68,0:11:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.59,0:11:14.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy there, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.51,0:11:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to learn fighting's\Nnot the only answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.48,0:11:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should only be your last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.14,0:11:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go back this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.54,0:11:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll come out on top\Nnear the control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.56,0:11:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.16,0:11:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why won't anyone listen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:29.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Davis, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.02,0:11:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw your sister today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.02,0:11:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah? So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She probably had a lot of bad\Nthings to say about me, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, actually... I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.54,0:11:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said that I'd bite my toenails\Nand spit them on the floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I used to suck my thumb\Nuntil about a month ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.22,0:11:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that I went to bed every other Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.84,0:11:52.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was laundry day, so it was all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, she talked too much, and when\NI see her, I'll teach her a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:57.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for sharing, but she\Ndidn't mention any of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:11:57.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.99,0:11:59.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your sister didn't say\Nanything bad about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, she didn't even mention you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.16,0:12:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one with the big mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.52,0:12:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you've got a problem with me,\Nwhy don't we settle it right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.40,0:12:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Matt, don't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.80,0:12:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's younger than you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He doesn't know any better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.30,0:12:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care how young he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.12,0:12:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd better learn some respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.60,0:12:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he think he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my sister, and if I want to call\Nher names, that's what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.50,0:12:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, that's what\Nbrothers are here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Davis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand anyone who talks bad\Nabout their brother or sister. Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.38,0:12:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She loves me, she hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.58,0:12:34.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She loves me, she hates me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.88,0:12:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Davis, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kari. She hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She thinks I'm a disgusting,\Nworthless piece of dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen David so depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.62,0:12:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to cheer him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.04,0:12:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know. Knock, knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.94,0:12:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do we get down from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.26,0:12:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.58,0:12:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too steep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.70,0:13:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we only had a rope or\Nsomething, we could climb down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:02.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.23,0:13:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go look for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, we'll be the rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just hang on to each other and\Nyou can climb down the bunny slope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.58,0:13:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our way of saying thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.80,0:13:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.56,0:13:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Davis, it's time for action.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take that overgrown tomato\Nand turn him into vegetable soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make vegetarians\Naround the world proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.92,0:13:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ought to cheer you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.86,0:13:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, head by.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now for a side dish,\Nchili pepper pummel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-Mod, Armored Digiball!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:45.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.60,0:13:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all dust! You'd like a salad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.32,0:14:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you've forgotten,\NI have the upper hand here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-Mod!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.18,0:14:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The key to good cooking is to always\Ntenderize thoroughly, like so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that your best shot? Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.34,0:14:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you feel about flying?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.50,0:14:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.04,0:14:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vemon doesn't stand a chance against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vemon, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.04,0:14:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Combine all your ingredients into a bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, stir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bland. Mix.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Combine all your ingredients into a bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.02,0:14:48.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, stir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bland. Mix. Frappé! And voila!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.02,0:14:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.38,0:14:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the entree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.20,0:14:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what you do, I'll never give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do my best to cheer\NDavis up, whatever the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This whole thing is my fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon is doing all this just for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.90,0:15:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leomon, you can stop now! I'm happy!\NI'm happy! I'm happy! You are? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.88,0:15:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave him alone now, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.98,0:15:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's had enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.20,0:15:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't doubt he's feeling a little full,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he must have saved room for dessert,\Nand I've cooked up a sweet surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.74,0:15:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I could Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be a way! But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,V-Mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:40.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now here's the\Nsurprise I promised you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.40,0:15:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A double helping of Spike\NPunch! V-Mon! Duck! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon! Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.20,0:16:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.58,0:16:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All my sisters, Digimon,\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.52,0:16:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon is a new champion!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.24,0:16:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, Digimon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.14,0:16:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.92,0:16:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, how did you Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.58,0:16:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Howling Blasters!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.78,0:16:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimental Up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.66,0:16:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.12,0:16:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.12,0:16:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Devimon, Armor! Digimon! Doom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.46,0:16:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digital monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.74,0:16:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:17:00.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armour! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.56,0:17:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fladramon, the fire of courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Flamefist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.40,0:17:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, am I glad to see you, Fladramon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.68,0:17:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for a little payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.38,0:17:25.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should give this overthrown\Nhouse plan a real cooking lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.72,0:17:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fladramon, get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want a piece of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that hurt fire rocket i've heard of grilled\Nvegetables before but this is ridiculous
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:48.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you did it davis
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.68,0:17:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon how are you able to digivolve\Ni'm not quite sure you know what i think
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.20,0:18:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when red Digimon's punch crack the control\Nspire and we were free from its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.70,0:18:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're certainly going\Nto need a lot of glue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should destroy the\Nspire once and for all
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.16,0:18:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and who better to do the job than Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.54,0:18:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digi armor hitter, jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.50,0:18:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadillo-mon on the Digivolve, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.08,0:18:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon, Digimon\Nare the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armor! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.42,0:18:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.54,0:18:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions! Stigma!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The drill of power! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.84,0:18:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock cracking!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.56,0:19:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I forgot to yell timber.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, did I get married\Nwhile I was asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.24,0:19:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now I see how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.40,0:19:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I inquire as to what\Nyou're talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.86,0:19:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.94,0:19:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It acted like an electricity rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon Emperor set it up to\Nsend out power to the Dark Rings,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.04,0:19:24.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making it possible for him to control\Nall the Digimon throughout the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:28.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm quite impressed\Nwith your theory, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.46,0:19:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how many more control spires there\Nare scattered around the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever the number is,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.38,0:19:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one thing we know for sure is\Nthey all have to be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite a tough mission for the new\NDigidestined, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.86,0:19:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to us, we can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.62,0:19:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.53,0:19:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess someone should take the\NGotsumon back to their homes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.74,0:19:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, I'll lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.24,0:19:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm right behind you, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon will stay here and\Nprotect you guys from the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.66,0:19:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.36,0:20:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad the Gotsumon aren't\Nstaying with us anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.58,0:20:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time they touched my\NCDs, they scratched them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.56,0:20:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they clogged the sink\Nwhen they brushed their teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were kind of cool, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone, I really think\Nyou should take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.08,0:20:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.30,0:20:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found it when I was\Nexamining your Digivice, Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.24,0:20:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems to be a map of the digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.64,0:20:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see this white square?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.60,0:20:22.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it used to be black until\Nwe destroyed the control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, there are a lot of black\Nsquares left, and they all have spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.60,0:20:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, Izzy,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.51,0:20:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's going to take a long time to turn\Nall those black squares into white ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how do we know he\Nwon't build new spires?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.32,0:20:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They go make the troll\Nspires like they used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.89,0:20:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.81,0:20:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a one-man wrecking crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.11,0:20:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A spire was destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.76,0:20:47.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be those meddling kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.16,0:20:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.07,0:20:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.99,0:20:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That area was pretty unimportant\Nin the grand scheme of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.58,0:20:55.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Within a year, I'll have every\Narea under my full control.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.78,0:20:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then finally,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.02,0:21:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,every living thing in the digital\Nworld will become my slave forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that includes those kids, too.
